# tfraglod.pad's title flight and village2 views only, with their shot pairs
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
1200 log view-begin title
1800 shot tfraglod_title_1800
1801 shot tfraglod_title_1801
2310 log view-end title
2320 continue village2-start
2321 wait *target* target-continue
2322 wait *target* target-stance
2620 log view-begin village2
2980 shot tfraglod_village2_a
2981 shot tfraglod_village2_b
2982 log view-end village2
2990 exit
